 Identification Division.
 Program-ID. ExecDli.
 Procedure Division.
 
*>EXECDLI GU USING PCB(PAUT-PCB-NUM)
SEGMENT (PAUTSUM0)
INTO (PENDING-AUTH-SUMMARY)
WHERE (ACCNTID = PA-ACCT-ID)
END-EXEC.
 
*>EXECDLI SCHD PSB((PSB-NAME)) NODHABEND END-EXEC.
 
  IF SOME-FLAG = 1
*>EXECDLI TERM
END-EXEC
  ELSE
    PERFORM NOTHING-TO-DO.